nfig/i386/cpuid.h#L323C1-L323C12) for the same task (I haven't tested the code):\n\n```suggestion\n        __get_cpuid(p_info, &r_cpuinfo[0], &r_cpuinfo[1], &r_cpuinfo[2], &r_cpuinfo[3]);\n```\n\nNot sure if that's any better. Unfortunate that there's no STL equivalent.","created_at":"2025-08-03T17:50:39Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T17:52:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109169#discussion_r2250075009","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109169","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2250075009"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109169#discussion_r2250075009"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109169"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2250075009/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":37,"original_start_line":36,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":42,"original_line":42,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":13,"position":14,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2250077920","pull_request_review_id":3082308511,"id":2250077920,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6GHXbg","diff_hunk":"@@ -29,6 +29,22 @@\n /**************************************************************************/\n \n #include <windows.h>\n+#ifdef _MSC_VER\n+#include <intrin.h> // For builtin __cpuid.\n+#else\n+void __cpuid(int *r_cpuinfo, int p_info) {\n+\t__asm__ __volatile__(\n+\t\t\t\"xchgq %%rbx, %q1;\"\n+\t\t\t\"cpuid;\"\n+\t\t\t\"xchgq %%rbx, %q1;\"\n+\t\t\t: \"=a\"(r_cpuinfo[0]), \"=r\"(r_cpuinfo[1]), \"=c\"(r_cpuinfo[2]), \"=d\"(r_cpuinfo[3])\n+\t\t\t: \"0\"(p_info));","path":"platform/windows/cpu_feature_validation.c","commit_id":"7c81d43b10f3e594f512c9d6272da3e73f4cbead","original_commit_id":"1bf44b1142da41396b7869c11823afe0b118f3